line	<str>The following responses should work. The first part is what the Skavid says. You must respond with the second part:</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the cave and go south to the Eastern City gate. Click on the gate to give a gold bar to the guard and gain access to the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue past the gate and across the bridge into the cave. Speak to the Mad Skavid, who will say one of these options. Repeat with the second part again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take another cave nightshade. Make sure you have two of them. You can hop worlds for the second one.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the way you came in (do not climb down the hole).</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Gu'Tanoth market.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one nightshade on one of the Enclave guards (be sure to complete the dialogue).</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave and watch the cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport out or run north to the exit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Watchtower wizard and talk to him.</str>
line	
line	<str>To create a vial of water add in the following order (do not use the ground bat bones first or the water will evaporate and you will need more bones):</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower wizard again, with the unfinished potion in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare to defend yourself against the various ogres and a blue dragon in the Ogre Enclave. Don't forget your anti-dragon shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the market square of Gu'Tanoth.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your nightshade on an Enclave guard to enter the cave again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the magic ogre potion on all 6 ogre shamans to get the 3rd crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click mine the Rock of Dalgroth in the centre of the Enclave for the 4th crystal.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the Watchtower wizard and return the crystals. (Leave the room and return if crystals remain on pillars before you have placed them.)</col>
step	46	-	Quick guide step 46
line	<str>Enter the top floor of the Watchtower.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower Wizard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down 2 ladders and search the far north-west bush to find fingernails.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower Wizard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Og north-west of Yanille to receive Toban's key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south and get onto the island by using a rope with the branch (not the tree) of the long-branched tree that is west of the island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Grew.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the hole south of Gu'Tanoth (the "Tunnel to Toban" on map above, dungeon icon south of Jiggig, and north-west of some ruins).</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill Gorad and take his tooth (be sure to have room in your inventory or you won't receive the tooth).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Toban.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Toban again with dragon bones in your inventory to receive Relic part 3.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the chest and take Toban's stolen gold.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Grew back on the Jangerberry island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back and talk to Og.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower Wizard, who will put the three relics together and give you an ogre relic.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter Gu'Tanoth via the path on the north-east corner of the hills, then head west towards the gate. Enter by talking to the Ogre Guard with the ogre relic in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-east to the market in the central area and steal a rock cake from the counter on the southern side.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the upper walkway, then head around south until you encounter guards at a battlement. Climb the battlement.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the guard again with the rock cake in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-east and attempt to jump the bridge, then agree to give the guards 20 coins.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to a City guard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to a City guard again with a death rune in your inventory to receive a skavid map.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return back across the bridges, over the battlement, and through the north-west gate where you entered the city.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk east, then turn south towards the second city gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Skavid caves just north of the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with the scared skavid.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the cave, and speak with each regular Skavid inside the following 4 caves:</str>
line	
line	<str>The following responses should work. The first part is what the Skavid says. You must respond with the second part:</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the cave and go south to the Eastern City gate. Click on the gate to give a gold bar to the guard and gain access to the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue past the gate and across the bridge into the cave. Speak to the Mad Skavid, who will say one of these options. Repeat with the second part again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take another cave nightshade. Make sure you have two of them. You can hop worlds for the second one.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the way you came in (do not climb down the hole).</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Gu'Tanoth market.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one nightshade on one of the Enclave guards (be sure to complete the dialogue).</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave and watch the cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport out or run north to the exit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Watchtower wizard and talk to him.</str>
line	
line	<str>To create a vial of water add in the following order (do not use the ground bat bones first or the water will evaporate and you will need more bones):</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower wizard again, with the unfinished potion in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare to defend yourself against the various ogres and a blue dragon in the Ogre Enclave. Don't forget your anti-dragon shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the market square of Gu'Tanoth.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your nightshade on an Enclave guard to enter the cave again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the magic ogre potion on all 6 ogre shamans to get the 3rd crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click mine the Rock of Dalgroth in the centre of the Enclave for the 4th crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Watchtower wizard and return the crystals. (Leave the room and return if crystals remain on pillars before you have placed them.)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Pull the <col=800000>lever</col> to the west.</col>
